{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年35歲、2014年落選港姐黃碧蓮（Linna），曾於處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》飾演「Dion」一角為人熟悉。去年9月25日，她與圈外獵頭公司創辦人兼總裁丈夫Jack Leung於峇里島舉行浪漫婚禮。巧合的是，在二人結婚一周年紀念日，兩人的兒子順利出世，正式升格為新手爸媽，可謂雙喜臨門。昨日（16日）Linna在IG上載了一段短片及長文，毫不吝嗇地直擊整個開刀生B過程，與網民分享誕下首胎、初為人母的百感交集。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃碧蓮去年9月結婚。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187882487116861440901672.png/KDtAH2nv8fzCuUHI57WZrsihSEKfIIGSqTG4pqkxuKY\"/><figcaption>黃碧蓮去年9月結婚。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攞過TVB十年服務金牌。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187882484633702400083175.jpeg/LVp0wj6jX4GEz1vfj3Go1DPToTk1hWjPT-y960_sves\"/><figcaption>攞過TVB十年服務金牌。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大肚look。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187878978296221696684023.jpeg/Gmx4igkY76_F4K1z6Fl8eEx52W_aUlhSRZoPHEWaDxw\"/><figcaption>大肚look。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一索得男！（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187878981802790912175239.jpeg/yQeB2xIhTAJAFtH2ppLk9jVH3t032d2tyy0Z7MstGew\"/><figcaption>一索得男！（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><p>做足功課依然驚到喊手狂震</p><p>為了迎接這一天，Linna坦言產前做足準備，但臨盆在即依然極度膽怯慌亂。她在貼文中以英文長文分享當時的恐懼：「直到我分娩嗰日，我幾乎吸收晒所有關於生BB嘅資訊，睇晒YouTube影片、睇育兒書，當然仲有聽晒所有媽媽朋友嘅意見。但呢啲都改變唔到我入產房時依然好驚嘅事實，因為『咩話？終於發生喇！』」</p><p>片中可見，躺在手術室病床上的她為了保持清醒、親眼見證BB出世的感動一刻，選擇非全身麻醉。面對人生第一次生產，產前壓力令她一度「驚到喊」，雙手更是不受控制地狂震，隔著螢幕都感受到她的膽怯慌亂。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃碧蓮公開分娩過程。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843425018449920145092.png/p7YzmVb6F3UiYd44iF9YPUP5uVIUDsKccfdBX3H3QV8\"/><figcaption>黃碧蓮公開分娩過程。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"緊張捉住老公隻手。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843427505803264965218.png/H8-oCeIlXawY6anTYPJ5XLS_01n1tetHGu7xfxru8X8\"/><figcaption>緊張捉住老公隻手。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"驚到手不停震！（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843639577939968615298.png/cXuL5v0d5jOC54ixA87gOcDCzT2BRJTdW5Mgp1uTIKc\"/><figcaption>驚到手不停震！（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"未有全身麻醉，生產過程全直擊。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843853110087680461073.png/7nJpx6ob1fajap6BRmVVBuTTBZpr6OSeov1oVKL9aFQ\"/><figcaption>未有全身麻醉，生產過程全直擊。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"未有全身麻醉，生產過程全直擊。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843855668744192408239.png/QepyTsGfMQ8P56t0YIe8BOgjDEIjIGR5a4iQw2uIkMM\"/><figcaption>未有全身麻醉，生產過程全直擊。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"未有全身麻醉，生產過程全直擊。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843858210623488789406.png/p0LiX3l2ij5gIvm8Ud6KQ5PPC8jssLWNEp8dKRKfHSk\"/><figcaption>未有全身麻醉，生產過程全直擊。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"感動爆喊。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187843860807028736923784.png/RbxYk8S1guV0kVuF3Q9MPwgZ_Q4zoJinUeymhVHspoU\"/><figcaption>感動爆喊。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><p>瘋狂尖叫感激醫護包容</p><p>在分娩過程中，Linna坦言自己叫到拆天，她特別發文感謝醫院團隊的照顧，讓整個過程十分順利：「好感激大家展現出嘅專業精神、溫柔同冷靜，喺我瘋狂尖叫嘅時候（while I was screaming my head off），大家都表現得好好。希望你哋嘅耳膜可以快啲恢復！」她亦幽默地向醫護人員致歉，並感謝院方服務團隊為房間安排的驚喜。</p><figure><img alt=\"順利誕B後成個人輕鬆晒！（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844015278657536058936.png/AspldibzUG_slxchfcANttDCg5mnF1ck3y43Jt8uNyY\"/><figcaption>順利誕B後成個人輕鬆晒！（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"順利誕B後成個人輕鬆晒！（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844012183130112235980.png/y1WmK5a7irwGPKxcAjG9Rna0sE1mLQr8TJ1K20ydSts\"/><figcaption>順利誕B後成個人輕鬆晒！（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"誕下一子。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844020479856640821436.png/ugV050uH_hexI97XoPse7ArzDzA7sNND6teSKOrXkig\"/><figcaption>誕下一子。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"食餐好。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844017925394432706183.png/MV0_ZOmtS_J6tFVwjQQ71Gkfz0C4qQGZzut_N87rfzc\"/><figcaption>食餐好。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><p>親餵母乳重展開心笑容</p><p>當聽到首胎BB呱呱落地的哭聲，Linna所有的痛楚與恐懼瞬間煙消雲散。影片後半段可見，順利誕下BB後，她隨即在產床上親自餵哺母乳。看著懷中健康的小生命，Linna終於放下心頭大石，開心重展幸福歡顏，由驚恐痛哭變成燦爛甜笑，散發出滿滿的母愛。</p><figure><img alt=\"攬實BB。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844290668138496754826.png/6jBw1SGJxvaMutHCDja4wP1G7BNtSmtxY-EPg2PhD4M\"/><figcaption>攬實BB。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"餵母乳。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1187919737368088576608459.png/y6hO5j5_9GJJYHWsaiH6PUWQKhZVvl-bQqfOK0Knzis\"/><figcaption>餵母乳。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"母子心連心。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844155708149760068943.png/UzwAmZa2BvONMbgEH-Zvx6JrwEGwBe8M3a-uV92vrlc\"/><figcaption>母子心連心。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"母子心連心。（IG@derplinna）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187844153015275520128657.png/yq2_MZ7U2lKryFAAzAYrHn8dBL54T9ZE6-srcuvrK3I\"/><figcaption>母子心連心。（IG@derplinna）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T05:19:50.257614+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1226,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T04:30:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T09:10:31.965945+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T05:17:59.433503+00:00","content_hash":"964302c252f4332cf00aee37cfc363a7c9f8682b5734bd9e7c4b7e62934840b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}